   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "Note"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "⚗ ALCHEMICA — COMPLETE PACKAGE (Krea 2 Turbo)\nIdea: AlchemicaMente · code: Claude (Anthropic)\n\n1 LOAD KREA 2: model + text encoder (type krea2) + VAE.\n2 PROMPT ENHANCER: write your IDEA in any language.\n  Krea 2's own text encoder writes SCENE / DETAIL / NEGATIVE.\n  Connect an image to 'immagine' to start from a reference\n  (empty idea = it describes the image).\n  creativita 0 = same text every time; 0.7 + seed = variations.\n  Want to write by hand? Remove the 3 links into ⚗ Text and\n  type into its fields.\n3 TEXT: scene (colours and style go HERE), detail (rendering\n  only: it takes over below sigma ~0.87), negative.\n4 ATTENTION GUIDANCE\n  NAG 3 from -1 = the negative works at cfg 1 WITHOUT changing\n  the composition (measured: water drops on the forehead gone,\n  image 99.3% identical). About +40% time.\n  nag_sigma_da 1.0 = the composition changes too.\n  struttura PAG 0.5-1 from -1 = crisper, more contrasty\n  rendering (removes some freckles). SEG: max 0.3.\n5 KREA PRO: anteprime (previews) = 8 to choose the composition\n  (seed on 'fixed'), then anteprime 0 + scelta (choice) = number.\n\n4 MP ~ 85-95 s with NAG on an RTX 5070 Ti."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653",
   "title": "⚗ AlchemicaMente · notes"
  }
